    "A **φροντιστήριο** is the private after-school institution where Greek teenagers prepare for the national exams, or a language school (**φροντιστήριο αγγλικών**). It is a fixture of Greek life; a university seminar or a short training course is a **σεμινάριο**.",
    ex=[("Μετά το σχολείο πάει φροντιστήριο μέχρι τις εννιά.", "After school he goes to cram school until nine.")],
